This is an original work: it does not copy upstream source code, and it invokes
only installed third-party parsers (urllib3, yarl, Node's built-in URL) at run
time. Those projects keep their own licenses; nothing from them is redistributed
here. The IPv4 reference in `urlhostdrift/ipv4_whatwg.py` is an independent
implementation of the WHATWG URL Standard algorithm, written for this project.
